  "rule":"These routes remain first-class LLD-03 transport authority. Device Reference identity is never replaced by Network Element identity; source-terminal evidence never executes cascade consequences; archive/hard-delete remain explicit governed operations; Working Notes remain SOMA-owned. Paged archive/cascade reads never weaken complete server-side authority: archive mutations revalidate their exact scope fingerprint, while terminal-cascade Execute carries the bounded RfcTerminalCascadeExecutionReviewV1 and revalidates complete RFC/WFM scope plus both provider impact summaries before deliberate proof/apply. Refresh returns exact persisted cascade state from its writer transaction; impact preview remains a separate read-only route."
